If the skill folder lives somewhere other than `skills/jira-to-task/`, fix the five
paths above to match — this file is a pointer and nothing else depends on it.

Two things Cursor-specific:

- You have repo access here, so Step 2 (grounding scope in real paths via
  Grep/Glob) is **not** optional — an unresolved path in `## In scope` costs a
  wasted loop iteration.
- Ask the interview questions as a numbered list with lettered options and a stated
  default, so the user can reply `1b, 2 default, 3 no` in one message.
